(async()=>{try{const s=await WildRideMember.session();if(!s.member)return;const data=await WildRideMember.request('assessments'),certs=data.certificates.filter(c=>!c.revoked_at);const note=document.createElement('aside');note.className='local-note';note.style.padding='16px';const title=document.createElement('b');title.textContent='我的教練核發證書';note.append(title);if(!certs.length)note.append(document.createTextNode('｜尚未核發，可在會員中心查看評量紀錄。'));for(const c of certs){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=WildRideMember.certificateUrl(c.id);a.textContent=' ✓ '+c.target+' 合格證書 ↗ ';a.style.margin='0 12px';note.append(a)}const target=document.getElementById('level-filters');target?.parentElement.before(note);const decorate=()=>{for(const c of certs){const card=document.getElementById('node-'+c.target);if(card&&!card.querySelector('.issued-proof')){const b=document.createElement('span');b.className='issued-proof';b.textContent='✓ 教練核發合格證書';b.style.cssText='display:block;margin-top:8px;color:#173e2c;font-weight:bold';card.append(b)}}};decorate();const map=document.querySelector('.skill-map-section');if(map)new MutationObserver(decorate).observe(map,{childList:true,subtree:true})}catch{/* Account errors are displayed by the main skill-tree interface. */}})();
